; Instantiate the proved quotient correspondence over R[X],
; with alpha=a1*X+a3 and beta=X^3+a2*X^2+a4*X+a6.
; This connects the source Y-polynomial quotient relation to the actual
; quadratic coordinate ring. The domain and norm-degree results remain open.
